---
description: Scientific backend contracts and persistence.
globs: services/api/**,services/workers/**,services/ai/**,infrastructure/db/**,packages/shared/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Use `cosmic-api-contracts` when routes, schemas, jobs, or persistence change.
Do not run intensive FITS processing inside an HTTP handler.
Pydantic/OpenAPI defines the contract; regenerate it with scripts/export_openapi.py.
Distinguish external failures from negative scientific results. Gemini requires evidence
and backend spending controls; never turn its output into a measurement.
